# request: "In the checkout design doc, show what checkout() in checkout/checkout.ts
#  calls, in order: it asks the Pricing API for a quote, reserves stock with the
#  Inventory API, charges the card through Stripe, then saves the order to the
#  Orders DB. Number the calls in the code and on the arrows."
type: code-calls
reader: engineers reading the checkout design doc
width: 800
direction: down
focus: none
out: retries, the stock release on a failed charge, logging
nodes:
  code: checkout/checkout.ts
  code.src: * {code}   # checkout/checkout.ts:8-15, verbatim
  pricing: Pricing API
  inventory: Inventory API
  stripe: Stripe {external}
  ordersdb: Orders DB {shape: cylinder}
edges:
  code -> pricing: 1. quote
  code -> inventory: 2. reserve
  code -> stripe: 3. charge
  code -> ordersdb: 4. save
